The commands of the first session and their output, in order (2026-11-11, local time of the
computer; UTC+1). The path of the home directory is replaced by `~`. Lines of `--list-ports` for
the serial ports of the computer itself (ttyS0 to ttyS3) are left out.

== Before: the board runs another firmware, which ignores the 1200-baud touch ==

$ mise run hardware -- --list-ports
/dev/ttyACM0  1209:0001  other (pid.codes test identifiers)  (the product name of that firmware)

$ date +%T; mise run hardware -- --bootloader; date +%T
00:25:09
error: the board did not enter its bootloader: double-tap its reset button (the orange LED fades in and out in the bootloader), then run again
[hardware] ERROR task failed
exit=3
00:25:27

(the reset button is double-tapped by hand; ModemManager is stopped)

